      "title": {
        "en": "Neat haircuts and fresh coats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight that their dogs and cats return looking thoroughly groomed, clean, and smelling fresh. Many pet parents praise precise styling cuts such as lion cuts and puppy trims, along with effective deshedding. Although one owner reported an injury during clipping, the vast majority are delighted with their pets' appearance."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Punctual and courteous groomers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers often commend the mobile groomers for their polite demeanor, punctuality, and clear dedication to client satisfaction. Groomers like Mabiel and Dylan are singled out for their courteous service and attentiveness to specific grooming requests. While one client noted an unapologetic response after a concern, most owners report friendly encounters."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently appreciate the gentle and calm handling given to nervous cats, rescue animals, and reactive dogs. Many clients mention that groomers work patiently to keep pets relaxed without unnecessary stress or trauma during the session. Aside from one report of discomfort, reviewers value the caring approach toward senior and sensitive pets."
      }
    }
  ],
